WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.410
What does a flat line on a journey graph mean?

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:05.140
Distance isn't changing.

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.900
So you've stopped.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.100
A steep line means fast.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.330
A gentle slope means slow.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:14.016
The steepness is the speed.
